+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/claims/{claimId}/comments — comment a claim: the comment is kept with who wrote it and the
+# sheet's today, and COMMENT_ADDED is audited. A blank comment is a 400 and a claim not on the sheet a 404, neither
+# writing anything (a viewer, an archived sheet and the as-of view are refused before, see ViewerGuard). Responds with
+# the claim as stored.
